==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|во-}} {{i|before certain consonant clusters}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|orv|въ-}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*vъ(n)-}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*h₁én}}. The {{IPAchar|/n/}} persists in {{m|ru|внять}}. See also {{m|ru|в}}, {{cog|orv|въ}}, {{cog|sla-pro|*vъ(n)}}. Compare the similar development in {{m|ru|с-}} from {{ncog|sla-pro|*sъ(n)-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|в-}} {{i|before vowels and voiced consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|ф-}} {{i|before voiceless consonants}}

